      "text": "# 👑 Aurolith: Map & Layout Canvas\n\n- **Total Grid:** 150 (Cols) x 90 (Rows) Hex Tiles\n- **Player 1 Castle:** North Anchor (Top)\n- **Player 2 Castle:** South Anchor (Bottom)\n- **Flanks:** West Jungle & East Jungle",
