      "type": "text",
      "text": "### 🌿 West Jungle Zone A (Left Flank)\n- **Dimensions:** 30 x 90 Hexes (c: 0–29)\n- **Mechanics:** 50% Canopy LoS Penalty, Creep Dens, 2:00 Tuskgod Elite Boss Arena.\n- **Choice:** Fair creep farming or stealth gank flank.",
