      "type": "text",
      "text": "### ⚔️ Central Battlefield & King's Highway\n- **Dimensions:** 90 x 90 Hexes (c: 30–119)\n- **The King's Highway:** Single direct North-to-South dirt road (+10% Move Speed) connecting North & South Gates.\n- **Centerpiece:** 12:00 Ancient Emperor Altar (6,000 HP).\n- **Fortresses:** North Castle (P1) & South Castle (P2).",
