      "text": "### 🌿 East Jungle Zone B (Right Flank)\n- **Dimensions:** 30 x 90 Hexes (c: 120–149)\n- **Mechanics:** 50% Canopy LoS, Creep Dens, 8:00 Stormwing Boss Pit.\n- **Choice:** Symmetric farming or disruption invasions.",
