      "type": "text",
      "text": "### ⏱️ Timeline & Overtime Flow\n- **Prep Phase:** Untimed ~90s Trait Draft\n- **Opening (0-5m):** Eco & Scouting (Siege Locked)\n- **Expansion (5-10m):** Skirmishes & Siege Online\n- **Siege (10-15m):** Primary Wall Breaches\n- **Overtime (15-18m):** Eco Ramp & Free Scout\n- **18:00 Tie-Breaker:** Cumulative Wall Damage",
